    Here's an alternate theory of what's gone wrong between men and
    women:  The problem isn't patriarchy, it's sociopathiarchy.  ...

    A lot of the more passive female strategies make sense if you're
    dealing with a sociopath--open disagreement would be extremely
    dangerous, so the best bet is either to give in and hope he'll
    change his mind or go away, or to manipulate him without his
    knowing it.

This may have been true at one time, but there are several modern
remedies that women can use which at least equalize the ability of
women to defend themselves against "sociopaths".  Buy and learn to use
a pistol (Amara recommends a Sig P225 (9mm), a Glock 19 (9mm) and a
Glock 23 (.40)).  You have an advantage that a small handgun is easier
to conceal in a purse than in men's clothing.  If you're not
temperamentally suited to a firearm, at least get some pepper spray or
take a martial arts class.

