risk to one's health and freedom.

I think Tim May and I are the only Extropians who have actually done
this. But I think it took Tim 10-12 years of "slavery" at Intel, and
it took me 28-29 years at IBM.

I enjoyed, for the most part, my IBM programming career. I have three
awards and a patent hanging on my wall, so I feel I made a
contribution. In the last few years of my career, I was being paid to
do "sandbox" programming projects with little supervision. That was a
